  <!-- EN: Healer Mech Serum -->
  <!-- EN: Grants the ability to make healer mech serum. A one-use super-dose of mechanites tuned to heal health conditions. The mechanites will target and heal the single worst health condition affecting someone at any given time. Works even on health conditions that would otherwise be incurable. The mechanites can even transmute themselves into organic matter, forming new limbs or organs as needed. -->
  <!-- EN: Ultratech Medicine -->
  <!-- EN: Grants the ability to make Ultratech Medicine. A kit of advanced ultra-tech medical supplies, probably manufactured on a distant glitterworld. It contains advanced polymorphic drugs, nanite diagnostic and healing assisters, a mini-imager, and various multi-use tools. -->
  <!-- EN: Neurotrainer Mech Serum -->
  <MSNeuroMechSerum.label>神经训练机甲血清</MSNeuroMechSerum.label>
  <!-- EN: Grants the ability to make neurotrainer mech serum. A one-use super-dose of mechanites tuned to train a specific skill. The dose is administered through the orbit of the eye. Once released into the brain, the mechanites quickly improve the subject's skills in a specific area, transmuting themselves into neural tissue as needed. -->
  <MSNeuroMechSerum.description>赋予制造神经训练机甲血清的能力。这是一种一次性使用的超剂量机械体，用于训练特定技能。剂量通过眼眶注射。一旦释放到大脑中，机械人就会迅速提高受试者特定领域的技能，并根据需要将自身转化为神经组织。</MSNeuroMechSerum.description>
  <!-- EN: Ressurector Mech Serum -->
  <!-- EN: Grants the ability to make ressurector mech serum. A one-use super-dose of mechanites tuned to resurrect the dead. Administered to a corpse, mechanites repair broken-down tissues and kickstart the body back to life. Unfortunately, the resurrected sometimes come back with brain damage, blindness, or progressive psychosis. Outcomes are better when the mechanites are administered to a fresher body. If a body is preserved, it can even be resurrected long after death. -->
